msgid "Craftable stats"
msgstr "可制作属性"

msgid "An item's description shows in grey what crafting would add to it next, and its bonus power (rulesets with crafting, such as MAW)."
msgstr "物品描述会用灰色显示下一次制作会为它增加什么，以及它的加成强度（适用于带制作系统的规则集，例如重铸版）。"

msgid "Show craftable stats (hold)"
msgstr "显示可制作属性（按住）"

msgid "Show Craftable Stats"
msgstr "显示可制作属性"

