# Terminology: Talents -> 专长 (天赋 is easily confused with innate race abilities; skills stay 技能)

msgid ""
"One adventurer in first person, with an action bar and talents. A party of one can become a solo run at any time; it stays one for the rest of the adventure."
msgstr "单人冒险：一名冒险者以第一人称行动，拥有快捷栏和专长。单人队伍可以随时转为单人冒险，转换后在整个冒险中保持单人。"

msgid "Forget talents (free)"
msgstr "遗忘专长（免费）"

msgid "{name} forgets every talent; the points are free again."
msgstr "{name} 遗忘了所有专长；点数重新可用。"

msgid "No talent points: the next comes at level {level}"
msgstr "没有专长点：下一点在 {level} 级获得"

msgid "Talents"
msgstr "专长"

msgid "Click: bind it (until you forget your talents at a training hall)."
msgstr "点击：绑定（直到你在训练场遗忘专长）。"

msgid "Point at a talent to read it."
msgstr "指向一个专长以阅读说明。"

msgid ""
"Your adventurer goes on in first person, with an action bar and talents, and the party stays one for the rest of the adventure. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "你的冒险者将以第一人称继续，拥有快捷栏和专长，队伍在整个冒险中保持一人。此操作无法撤销。"
